Store in the metadata of the pipeline components the names of the parameters given when creating them (``_fields_set``) and, for the components that are not built-in, the module that registered them (``_with``), which are not part of the MD5 of the features, and add :class:`.PipelineComponentModel`, the base model of the DataGrabbers, DataReaders, preprocessors and markers capturing them by `Fede Raimondo`_
